Result:
5px border-width
medium border-width
2px border-width
thick border-width

Specific Side Widths
The
border-width
property can have from one to four values (for the top border, right border, 
bottom border, and the left border):
Example
p.one {
border-style: solid;
border-width: 5px 20px; /* 
  5px top and bottom, 20px on the sides */
}
p.two {
border-style: 
  solid;
